  (Baevski, Zhou, Mohamed and Auli, "wav2vec 2.0", 2020). Licence: Apache License 2.0 (model card front matter
  `license: apache-2.0` at that commit). The upstream repository ships no LICENSE or NOTICE file of its own.
- Modification: converted to a Core ML package (float32) by tools/convert_ctc.py with coremltools 8.3.0
  (BSD-3-Clause), run only by scripts/fetch-ctc.sh in a local Python venv. The weights are not changed.

The upstream files and the converted package are fetched and built by scripts/fetch-ctc.sh and SHA-256 pinned in
